        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "權大参事　五員（四員）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "権大参事（ごんだいさんじ）五員（四員）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Acting Grand Councillor (gon-dai-sanji): the main figure prints 五員 (5) but an interlinear warichu correction reads 四員 (4). The roster confirms four (松宮源太郎, 水野内藏丞, 酒井吉之丞, 菅善太右衞門), and the page total 2+4+5+2 = 13 matches the 13 name columns, so the corrected value 4 is the true count. 權 printed in kyūjitai. Box spans 權大参事 through the parenthetical 四員."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "権大参事"
      }
    ],
